msgid ""
"Linux natively excels at terminal and SSH management. Windows terminal emulators are redundant and may have integration issues.\n"
"\n"
"For SSH, use your native Terminal. For comprehensive remote desktop management (RDP/VNC/SSH), we recommend Remmina."
